This repository distributes prebuilt native libraries (internal/ffi/lib/)
that statically link Rivet (rivetkit-core and related crates) from
https://github.com/rivet-dev/rivet, licensed under the Apache License 2.0,
together with other third-party Rust crates. The complete set of third-party
licenses redistributed in those binaries is recorded in
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md, which is regenerated by scripts/build-ffi.sh whenever
the binaries are rebuilt.

crates/rivet-depot-client-pinned/ is vendored from rivet-dev/rivet v2.3.10
(Apache License 2.0) and carries a local modification: the zero-length BLOB
decoder correction documented in docs/FFI-BOUNDARY.md.

The optional development engine built or cached by internal/devengine is
compiled locally from the pinned rivet-dev/rivet tag and is not redistributed
by this repository; it remains covered by upstream's Apache License 2.0.
